#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:1 cedf907486904aa5b65e203214b9a7e7
msgid "模型训练"
msgstr "Model Training"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:3 a5633543929f4cc8ab452440755e34c9
msgid ""
"本指南介绍如何在 UniKT "
"中启动知识追踪模型的训练流程，包括单折快速实验、训练过程控制（参数配置、早停策略与断点续训），以及运行产物的结构与日志输出。"
msgstr ""
"This guide details how to launch training pipelines for knowledge tracing"
" models in UniKT, covering single-fold fast experiments, training "
"controls (parameter configuration, early stopping, checkpoint "
"resumption), artifact structures, and logging outputs."

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:7 0afe730c6363457094eb8d49656342ae
msgid "单折快速训练"
msgstr "Single-Fold Fast Training"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:9 9021375d5d624fcd8a3d0d7de1216387
msgid "在算法研发与代码调试阶段，通常指定单一折（如第 0 折）进行快速试验。"
msgstr ""
"During algorithm prototyping and debugging, it is common to specify a "
"single fold (e.g., fold 0) for rapid experimentation."

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:11 5fed446286b34cd683a3c7a7b116a767
msgid "启动训练命令"
msgstr "Launch Training Command"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:13 2be1cd0beb36445a82cf65b95f789a49
msgid "使用 `train.py` 启动训练，通过 `-m` 指定模型名称，`-d` 指定数据集："
msgstr ""
"Launch training using `train.py`, specifying model name with `-m` and "
"dataset with `-d`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:15 2c125784f7f141af8a6e4af74c3e4b0f
msgid "python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:19 6fa64a8836df41bea773ab47b6ccaec6
msgid ""
"上述命令将以 `assistments09` 数据集的第 0 折作为测试集、第 4 折作为验证集启动 GIKT 模型的训练。UniKT "
"采用分层反射式 CLI 体系，所有参数结构与代码中的配置类树严格对齐。"
msgstr ""
"The command above starts GIKT model training using fold 0 of "
"`assistments09` as test set and fold 4 as validation set. UniKT employs a"
" hierarchical reflective CLI system strictly aligned with configuration "
"dataclass trees in code."

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:21 dce8b5ab7ff14c209d9a70bef20051ac
msgid "核心参数配置"
msgstr "Core Parameter Configuration"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:23 9a8182d26a464909a5b7476a6d980b6e
msgid "常用训练参数可以通过分层命名空间传入："
msgstr ""
"Frequently used training parameters can be passed via hierarchical "
"namespaces:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:25 b2102340b1ce42f0bc444b063bfa36bc
msgid ""
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --data.fold 0 \\\n"
"  --model.epochs 100 \\\n"
"  --model.batch_size 128 \\\n"
"  --model.learning_rate 0.001 \\\n"
"  --model.weight_decay 1e-5 \\\n"
"  --general.device cuda:0 \\\n"
"  --general.seed 42 \\\n"
"  --general.deterministic true\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --data.fold 0 \\\n"
"  --model.epochs 100 \\\n"
"  --model.batch_size 128 \\\n"
"  --model.learning_rate 0.001 \\\n"
"  --model.weight_decay 1e-5 \\\n"
"  --general.device cuda:0 \\\n"
"  --general.seed 42 \\\n"
"  --general.deterministic true\n"

