#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:51 6eaa5f5f41d5444ca6ff118d281e3684
msgid ""
"查看特定模型的专属超参数 如需查看特定模型独有的超参数（例如 GIKT 的 `--model.agg_type` 或 "
"`--model.gcn_layers`），可以在命令末尾加入 `-h` 查看该模型的反射参数帮助："
msgstr ""
"Inspect Model-Specific Hyperparameters: To inspect hyperparameters unique"
" to a model (such as `--model.agg_type` or `--model.gcn_layers` for "
"GIKT), append `-h` to view reflected parameter help:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:53 a0501aad2f164fa088700928293686c3
msgid "python train.py -m GIKT -h\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m GIKT -h\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:59 45f54ed8ed404a4ebf5b5169a230e749
msgid "训练过程控制与早停机制"
msgstr "Training Process Control and Early Stopping"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:61 b6409738bef24af4a1e3a53b5bae9953
msgid "早停机制"
msgstr "Early stopping mechanism"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:63 a561d12c7b6e465e8fb58bb00c4d269b
msgid "UniKT 内置了基于验证集指标监控的早停机制，在指标不再提升时提前终止训练，避免算力浪费并自动保留最佳模型权重："
msgstr ""
"UniKT includes built-in early stopping based on validation metrics, "
"terminating training when metrics cease improving to save compute and "
"retain optimal checkpoints:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:65 5409a99b831e403db6a02b7209f26f24
msgid ""
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --data.fold 0 \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.patience 10 \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.monitor auc \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.mode max \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.min_delta 0.0005\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --data.fold 0 \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.patience 10 \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.monitor auc \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.mode max \\\n"
"  --early_stopping.min_delta 0.0005\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 bf43d35e3abd4ef5b160bdf589c20722
msgid "早停参数"
msgstr "Early Stopping Parameter"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 870144c053f447448bbaafaf09178279
msgid "`--early_stopping.patience`"
msgstr "`--early_stopping.patience`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 3ccc5bd5891c4f1094d532ba06ac0eb4
msgid "`10`"
msgstr "`10`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 6713966bcaa04778981fa9da4e454d51
msgid "容忍指标未提升的连续 Epoch 轮数。设为 `0` 时禁用早停"
msgstr ""
"Consecutive epochs tolerated without metric improvement. Set to `0` to "
"disable early stopping"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 6573b0bb506d41f6b530516b8b150a4d
msgid "`--early_stopping.monitor`"
msgstr "`--early_stopping.monitor`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 b585d33d7a674f7fb2d773ebe38486f6
msgid "`auc`"
msgstr "`auc`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 6b6c666f52f448ef9435c73bb2956e40
msgid "监控的目标指标，支持 `auc`, `acc`, `rmse`, `loss`"
msgstr "Target metric monitored, supporting `auc`, `acc`, `rmse`, `loss`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 d57c94a87e764f8a9d16693f2fde90ce
msgid "`--early_stopping.mode`"
msgstr "`--early_stopping.mode`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 ba513ec2e7fe40c9a5adbfb4b07345b0
msgid "`max`"
msgstr "`max`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 680939e0eb504c83b020e1a50b5e3055
msgid "优化方向：`max`（指标越大越好，如 AUC、ACC）或 `min`（指标越小越好，如 RMSE、Loss）"
msgstr ""
"Optimization direction: `max` (higher is better, e.g., AUC, ACC) or `min`"
" (lower is better, e.g., RMSE, Loss)"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 d05bf8512f444680b790d7ca5d93b3d6
msgid "`--early_stopping.min_delta`"
msgstr "`--early_stopping.min_delta`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 09585eefaf06499ca475007229e7ee62
msgid "`0.0`"
msgstr "`0.0`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:50 4ff4582c813040feb56c9195fbda9fba
msgid "判定为有效提升的最小变化绝对阈值"
msgstr "Minimum absolute change threshold considered an improvement"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:81 ac7e125bc99048fab17b367d7d45c88e
msgid "当早停触发时，训练循环将打印提示，且保存在磁盘上的 `best_model.pth` 始终对应监控指标表现最优的那一轮权重。"
msgstr ""
"When early stopping triggers, the training loop logs an alert; "
"`best_model.pth` saved on disk strictly retains the weights from the "
"highest-performing epoch."

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:83 3f82223bbacc4cd699aeceb7f3d0339c
msgid "检查点恢复与断点续训"
msgstr "Checkpoint Resumption and Fine-tuning"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:85 72b30d3d96334fa08baa1a8e47d6d375
msgid "如果训练被意外中断，或者希望在保存的检查点基础上继续微调，可以使用 `--general.checkpoint_path` 参数："
msgstr ""
"If training was interrupted or you wish to fine-tune from a saved "
"checkpoint, use `--general.checkpoint_path`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:87 45a0a6d8da504fcf847dc9a5758db2c9
msgid ""
"# 1. 确保在初始训练时保存了最后一轮状态（默认已开启）\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --general.save_last_checkpoint true\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 从指定检查点恢复模型权重并继续训练\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --general.checkpoint_path "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/best_model.pth"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"# 1. Ensure saving the last epoch state during initial training (enabled "
"by default)\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --general.save_last_checkpoint true\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Resume weights from checkpoint and continue training\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --general.checkpoint_path "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/best_model.pth"
"\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/training.md:99 8b414e6c9c914c34a483f688d4f2d57d
